flowchart TD
    accTitle: Check outside data before using it
    accDescr: A storage handler returns either a read error or raw text. Decoding raw text returns either a validation error or an Entry. Only an Entry reaches summary.
    A["Storage handler"] --> B{"Read result"}
    B -->|Error| C["Keep error"]
    B -->|Success| D["Raw text"]
    D --> E{"decodeTitle"}
    E -->|Error| F["Keep error"]
    E -->|Success| G["Entry"]
    G --> H["Pure summary"]
